\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. JESUS! The name high over all,
\par In hell, or earth, or sky;
\par Angels and men before it fall,
\par And devils fear and fly.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Jesus! The name to sinners dear,
\par The name to sinners given;
\par It scatters all their guilty fear
\par It turns their hell yo heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus! The prisoner's fetters breaks,
\par And bruises Satan's head;
\par Power into strengthless souls it speaks
\par And life into the dead.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. O that the world might taste and see
\par The riches of His grace
\par The arms of love that compass me
\par Would all mankind embrace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. His only righteousness I show,
\par His saving Grace proclaim;
\par 'Tis all my business here below
\par To cry: Behold the Lamb.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Happy, if with my latest breath
\par I might but gasp His name ,
\par Preach Him to all, and cry in death:
\par Behold, behold the Lamb!
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

